Z||000018||mwbackus||10-01-1999||08:19 PM||||Well, if it makes any difference, I have never owned a ford (I drove one lately).  My VR4 is just one of my projects which have included many different cars:<BR>81 Citation X-11<BR>86 Fiero 2M6<BR>91 Eclipse GSX<BR>94 Dodge Spirit ES<BR>88 Fiero Formula<BR>I am Currently working on an 88 Fiero GT with a turbocharged/intercooled 4.3L transplant rated stock at a yummy 275hp.  As far as "chick magnets" go, I am a bit too old for that (40yrs), and after 2 failed marriages, not all that interested in the headaches involved.<P>Mike<BR> ||||reg||7
